<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>DiabetesCare AI</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@400;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#050b1a;--bg2:#0a1630;--ink:#e8f1ff;--mut:#9aaccb;--cy:#22d3ee;--te:#14b8a6;--mi:#6ee7b7;--vi:#8b5cf6;--line:rgba(120,180,255,.16);--glass:rgba(14,28,56,.62);--warn:#f5b84b;--bad:#fb7185;
--d:'Sora',system-ui,sans-serif;--b:'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);color-scheme:dark}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:inherit}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:84px}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:400 16px/1.6 var(--b);overflow-x:hidden}
body::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:radial-gradient(60% 50% at 80% 8%,rgba(34,211,238,.14),transparent 70%),radial-gradient(50% 40% at 10% 40%,rgba(139,92,246,.12),transparent 70%),linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),var(--bg2) 60%,var(--bg))}
a{color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--cy);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:6px}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--d);line-height:1.12;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.02em}
h1{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5.2vw,4.1rem)}h2{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.4vw,2.6rem)}h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p{margin:0}.mut{color:var(--mut)}
.wrap{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 22px}
section{padding:104px 0;position:relative}
#prog{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;height:3px;width:100%;transform-origin:0 50%;transform:scaleX(0);background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--cy),var(--mi));z-index:60}
nav{position:fixed;top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);left:0;right:0;z-index:50;transition:background .3s,border-color .3s,padding .3s;padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px solid transparent}
nav.s{background:rgba(5,11,26,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-color:var(--line);padding:10px 0}
nav .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font:700 1.05rem var(--d);text-decoration:none}
.links{display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center}
.links a{padding:8px 13px;border-radius:99px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--mut);font-size:.93rem;transition:color .2s,background .2s}
.links a:hover,.links a.on{color:var(--ink);background:rgba(34,211,238,.1)}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:transparent;color:var(--ink);font:600 .95rem var(--b);cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s,border-color .2s}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:var(--cy)}
.btn.p{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--cy),var(--te));color:#04141c;border:0;box-shadow:0 8px 28px -10px rgba(34,211,238,.7)}
.menu{display:none;background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer}
.hero{min-height:100svh;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:120px 0 70px}
.hero .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:36px;align-items:center}
.hero p.lead{margin:22px 0 30px;max-width:52ch;color:var(--mut);font-size:1.08rem}
.cta{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.note{margin-top:22px;font-size:.84rem;color:var(--mut);max-width:56ch}
.stage{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1;max-width:520px;width:100%;margin:0 auto;perspective:900px}
.orb{position:absolute;inset:0;transform-style:preserve-3d;transform:rotateX(var(--rx,10deg)) rotateY(var(--ry,-12deg));transition:transform .25s ease-out}
.core{position:absolute;inset:24%;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 32% 28%,#a5f3fc,#22d3ee 22%,#0e5a7a 55%,#071a38 80%);box-shadow:0 0 90px 10px rgba(34,211,238,.35),inset -20px -26px 50px rgba(5,11,26,.7);animation:breathe 6s ease-in-out infinite}
.ring{position:absolute;inset:6%;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid rgba(110,231,183,.5);animation:spin 18s linear infinite}
.ring.b{inset:14%;border-color:rgba(34,211,238,.55);transform:rotateX(70deg);animation-duration:24s}
.ring.c{inset:0;border-color:rgba(139,92,246,.5);border-style:dashed;transform:rotateY(68deg);animation-duration:30s;animation-direction:reverse}
.ring.a{transform:rotateX(72deg) rotateY(18deg)}
.ring i{position:absolute;top:-5px;left:50%;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--mi);box-shadow:0 0 14px var(--mi)}
.chip{position:absolute;padding:9px 13px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--line);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.35;animation:float 7s ease-in-out infinite;transform:translateZ(60px)}
.chip b{display:block;font:600 .95rem var(--d);color:var(--cy)}
@keyframes spin{to{rotate:360deg}}@keyframes float{50%{translate:0 -10px}}@keyframes breathe{50%{filter:brightness(1.18)}}
.cue{position:absolute;bottom:22px;left:50%;translate:-50% 0;color:var(--mut);font-size:.82rem;text-decoration:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.cue span{width:1px;height:34px;background:linear-gradient(var(--cy),transparent);animation:drop 2s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes drop{0%{transform:scaleY(0);transform-origin:top}50%{transform:scaleY(1);transform-origin:top}51%{transform-origin:bottom}100%{transform:scaleY(0);transform-origin:bottom}}
.head{max-width:62ch;margin-bottom:44px}.head p{margin-top:14px;color:var(--mut)}
.glass{background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;backdrop-filter:blur(10px)}
.dims{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;position:relative}
.dim{padding:26px;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;color:inherit;font:inherit;transition:transform .35s,border-color .3s,box-shadow .3s;transform-style:preserve-3d}
.dim:hover,.dim[aria-expanded=true]{transform:translateY(-6px) rotateX(3deg);border-color:var(--cy);box-shadow:0 22px 50px -24px rgba(34,211,238,.55)}
.dim svg{width:44px;height:44px;margin-bottom:16px}
.dim p{margin-top:8px;color:var(--mut);font-size:.95rem}
.more{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s;color:var(--ink);font-size:.9rem}
.dim[aria-expanded=true] .more{max-height:200px;margin-top:12px}
.hub{text-align:center;margin-top:20px;color:var(--mut);font-size:.9rem}
.tag{display:inline-block;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid rgba(245,184,75,.5);color:var(--warn);font-size:.78rem;background:rgba(245,184,75,.07)}
.board{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr);gap:18px}
.card{padding:24px;min-width:0}
.card h3{margin-bottom:4px}.card .sub{color:var(--mut);font-size:.86rem;margin-bottom:14px}
.c4{grid-column:span 4}.c5{grid-column:span 5}.c6{grid-column:span 6}.c7{grid-column:span 7}.c8{grid-column:span 8}.c12{grid-column:span 12}
svg text{fill:var(--mut);font:11px var(--b)}
.ax{stroke:var(--line)}
.bar{fill:url(#gb);cursor:pointer;transition:opacity .2s,filter .2s}.bar:hover,.bar:focus{filter:brightness(1.35);outline:none}.bar.sel{fill:var(--mi)}
.pt{cursor:pointer;transition:r .15s}.pt:hover,.pt:focus{r:7;outline:none}
.legend{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:6px 0 10px}
.legend button,.seg button{background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);border-radius:99px;padding:5px 12px;font:500 .8rem var(--b);cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;gap:7px;align-items:center}
.legend button[aria-pressed=false]{opacity:.45;text-decoration:line-through}
.legend i{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%}
.seg{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px}.seg button[aria-pressed=true]{background:rgba(34,211,238,.15);border-color:var(--cy)}
.detail{margin-top:10px;min-height:2.8em;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--mut)}
.detail b{color:var(--ink)}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.88rem}
th,td{text-align:left;padding:9px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
th button{all:unset;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)}th button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--cy)}
tbody tr:hover{background:rgba(34,211,238,.07)}
.pill{padding:2px 10px;border-radius:99px;font-size:.78rem;border:1px solid}
.range{width:100%;accent-color:var(--cy);margin-top:6px}
#tip{position:fixed;z-index:90;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;transition:opacity .15s;max-width:260px;padding:10px 13px;border-radius:10px;background:#07122a;border:1px solid rgba(34,211,238,.4);font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.45;box-shadow:0 14px 34px -12px #000}
#tip b{color:var(--cy);display:block;font-family:var(--d)}
.feat{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
.f{padding:26px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .3s,border-color .3s}
.f::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:auto -30% -60% auto;width:70%;aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:50%;background:var(--g,var(--cy));opacity:.12;filter:blur(30px);transition:opacity .3s}
.f:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);border-color:var(--g,var(--cy))}.f:hover::after{opacity:.28}
.f svg{width:34px;height:34px;margin-bottom:14px;stroke:var(--g,var(--cy))}
.f p{margin-top:8px;color:var(--mut);font-size:.93rem}
.flow{position:relative;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin:10px 0 28px}
.flow::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:34px;left:7%;right:7%;height:2px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,var(--cy) 0 10px,transparent 10px 20px);opacity:.5;animation:dash 1.4s linear infinite}
@keyframes dash{to{background-position:20px 0}}
.node{position:relative;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:none;border:0;color:var(--mut);font:600 .9rem var(--d);cursor:pointer;text-align:center}
.node span{width:68px;height:68px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#08142c;border:1.5px solid var(--line);font:700 1.1rem var(--d);color:var(--ink);transition:.3s}
.node:hover span,.node[aria-selected=true] span{border-color:var(--mi);box-shadow:0 0 30px -4px var(--mi);transform:scale(1.08)}
.node[aria-selected=true]{color:var(--ink)}
.panel{padding:24px;min-height:110px}
.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px}
.two .glass{padding:24px}.two p{margin-top:8px;color:var(--mut);font-size:.94rem}
.slot{border:1px dashed rgba(34,211,238,.35);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;color:var(--mut);font-size:.88rem;text-align:center}
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:46px 0 60px;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--mut)}
footer .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:30px}
footer nav{all:unset;display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px);transition:opacity .8s,transform .8s}.rv.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
.hero .rv:nth-child(2){transition-delay:.12s}.hero .rv:nth-child(3){transition-delay:.24s}
@media(max-width:900px){.hero .wrap,.dims,.feat,.two,footer .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}.stage{max-width:360px}.c4,.c5,.c6,.c7,.c8{grid-column:span 12}
section{padding:72px 0}.menu{display:block}.links{display:none;position:absolute;top:100%;left:12px;right:12px;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;background:#07122a;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:8px}.links.open{display:flex}
.flow{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}.flow::before{display:none}.node{flex-direction:row;text-align:left}.node span{width:52px;height:52px}.chip.x{display:none}.cue{display:none}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}html{scroll-behavior:auto}.rv{opacity:1;transform:none}}

/* Live model forms */
.dc-form{margin-top:16px}
.dc-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:13px}
.dc-fields label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;color:var(--mut);font-size:.82rem;min-width:0}
.dc-fields input,.dc-fields select{width:100%;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:11px 12px;background:rgba(7,19,35,.82);color:var(--ink);font:500 .9rem var(--b);outline:none}
.dc-fields input:focus,.dc-fields select:focus{border-color:var(--cy);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(34,211,238,.12)}
.dc-fields select option{background:#0b1729;color:#f0f7ff}
.dc-submit{margin-top:18px;width:100%;justify-content:center}
.dc-status{font-size:.86rem;color:var(--mut);margin-top:12px;min-height:1.2em}
.dc-status[data-state="error"]{color:#fda4af}
.dc-status[data-state="success"]{color:var(--te)}
.dc-result{margin-top:12px;padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:rgba(5,15,28,.72);overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.dc-result[hidden]{display:none}
.dc-result h4{font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--ink)}
.dc-score{font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.04em;color:var(--cy)}
.dc-result p{color:var(--mut);font-size:.86rem;margin-top:7px}
.dc-result pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font: .78rem/1.5 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;color:var(--ink);margin-top:12px}
.dc-disclaimer{margin-top:12px;font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--mut)}
@media(max-width:560px){.dc-fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}.dc-fields label{font-size:.86rem}}


/* Real API dashboard */
#insights .card.c5,
#insights .card.c7,
#insights .card.c8,
#insights .card.c4,
#insights .card.c12:not(.api-panel) { display: none !important; }

.api-panel { margin-top: 22px; }
.api-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(155px,1fr)); gap:12px; margin-top:16px; }
.api-stat { padding:15px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.035); min-width:0; }
.api-stat .value { font-size:1.55rem; font-weight:750; letter-spacing:-.04em; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.api-stat .label { color:var(--mut); font-size:.78rem; margin-top:5px; }
.api-note { color:var(--mut); font-size:.84rem; line-height:1.55; margin-top:12px; }
.api-table-wrap { overflow-x:auto; margin-top:14px; }
.api-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; min-width:680px; }
.api-table th,.api-table td { padding:11px 10px; text-align:left; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); font-size:.84rem; vertical-align:top; }
.api-table th { color:var(--mut); font-weight:650; white-space:nowrap; }
.api-tier { display:inline-block; padding:4px 9px; border-radius:999px; font-size:.76rem; font-weight:700; background:rgba(255,255,255,.08); }
.api-toolbar { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; align-items:center; margin-top:15px; }
.api-toolbar input,.api-toolbar select,.api-intervention input,.api-intervention select,.api-intervention textarea {
  color:var(--ink); background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; padding:10px 12px; font:inherit; max-width:100%;
}
.api-toolbar input { flex:1 1 220px; }
.api-toolbar select { min-width:145px; }
.api-intervention { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(145px,1fr)); gap:8px; min-width:290px; }
.api-intervention textarea { grid-column:1/-1; min-height:58px; resize:vertical; }
.api-intervention button { justify-self:start; }
.api-status { min-height:1.3em; margin-top:10px; font-size:.84rem; color:var(--mut); }
.api-status.error { color:#ff8585; }
.api-status.success { color:#72d6a0; }
.api-coverage { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr)); gap:12px; margin-top:14px; }
.api-coverage-item { padding:14px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; }
.api-coverage-item strong { display:block; margin-bottom:5px; }
.api-coverage-item span { display:inline-block; font-size:.76rem; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:7px; }
.api-actions { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; align-items:center; margin-top:12px; }
.api-small { font-size:.78rem; color:var(--mut); }
@media(max-width:600px) {
  .api-stat .value { font-size:1.25rem; }
  .api-intervention { min-width:250px; }
}


/* Simplified user-facing layout */
#platform,
#how {
  display: none !important;
}

</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="prog"></div>
<nav id="nav"><div class="wrap">
<a class="brand" href="#home" aria-label="DiabetesCare AI home"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="lg" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#22d3ee"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#6ee7b7"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M16 3C9 12 6 16 6 20a10 10 0 0020 0c0-4-3-8-10-17z" fill="none" stroke="url(#lg)" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M10 20h3l2-4 3 7 2-3h2" fill="none" stroke="url(#lg)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>DiabetesCare AI</a>
<button class="menu" id="menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="links">Menu</button>
<div class="links" id="links">
  <a href="#home">Home</a>
  <a href="#worklist">Worklist</a>
  <a href="#readmission-form">Assessments</a>
  <a href="#api-model-metrics">Model information</a>
  <a href="#about">Responsible use</a>
</div>
</div></nav>

<main>
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <h1 class="rv">DiabetesCare AI</h1>
      <p class="lead rv">Explore research-based hospital readmission assessments, diabetes-status assessments, and a retrospective worklist with follow-up tracking.</p>
      <div class="cta rv">
        <a class="btn p" href="#worklist">Open worklist</a>
        <a class="btn" href="#readmission-form">Run an assessment</a>
      </div>
      <p class="note rv">Research prototype only. Not a medical device, diagnosis, or clinically validated tool. Predictions require human review.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="platform"><div class="wrap">
<div class="head rv"><h2>Three kinds of information, one picture</h2><p>The platform is designed around three analytical dimensions. They describe where the project is heading; they are not a claim that every dataset is already connected.</p></div>
<div class="dims rv" id="dims"></div>
<p class="hub rv">Select a panel to see what each dimension would contribute.</p>
<div class="head rv" style="margin-top:84px"><h2>What the project explores</h2><p>Each capability below is an intended direction, not shipped functionality.</p></div>
<div class="feat rv" id="feat"></div>
</div></section>

<section id="insights"><div class="wrap">
<div class="head rv">
  <h2>Project tools and results</h2>
  <p>Use the assessments and retrospective worklist below. Model results and dataset limitations are available for transparency.</p>
</div>
<div class="board rv">
<div class="glass card c5"><h3>Readmission score gauge</h3><div class="sub">Demo score and demo tier cutoffs</div><div id="gauge"></div><label class="mut" style="font-size:.84rem" for="gs">Try a demo score: <b id="gv" style="color:var(--ink)"></b></label><input class="range" id="gs" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="62"><div class="detail" id="gd" aria-live="polite"></div></div>
<div class="glass card c7"><h3>Score distribution</h3><div class="sub">Demo cohort, share of records per score band. Click a bar.</div><div id="bars"></div><div class="detail" id="bd" aria-live="polite">Select a bar for details.</div></div>
<div class="glass card c8"><h3>Indicator trend</h3><div class="sub">Demo monthly values. Toggle series or change the range.</div><div class="seg" id="seg"></div><div class="legend" id="leg"></div><div id="line"></div><div class="detail" id="ld" aria-live="polite">Select a point for details.</div></div>
<div class="glass card c4"><h3>Reading the demo</h3><div class="sub">Plain-language notes</div><p class="mut" style="font-size:.9rem">A model score ranks records relative to each other. It is not a calibrated probability, so 0.62 does not mean a 62% chance of anything. Tier labels depend on cutoffs that would need validation.</p><div class="slot" style="margin-top:14px">Model explanation panel will appear here once real outputs are connected.</div></div>
<div class="glass card c12"><h3>Indicator summary</h3><div class="sub">Demo rows. Sort by selecting a column heading.</div><div style="overflow-x:auto"><table id="tbl"><caption class="mut" style="text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;padding-bottom:6px">Illustrative values only</caption><thead></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div></div>

<div class="glass card c12 api-panel">
  <h3>Model performance dashboard</h3>
  <p class="sub">Metrics from the saved held-out test evaluations. These are research results, not clinical validation.</p>
  <div id="api-dashboard-status" class="api-status" role="status">Loading evaluation metrics?</div>
  <div id="api-model-metrics"></div>
</div>

<div class="glass card c12 api-panel">
  <h3>Readmission risk-tier analysis</h3>
  <p class="sub">Observed results across the retrospective held-out test encounters. Tier scores are not calibrated clinical probabilities.</p>
  <div id="api-tier-results"></div>
</div>

<div class="glass card c12 api-panel">
  <h3>Data coverage and integration limits</h3>
  <p class="sub">What the current datasets actually contain ? and what is still missing.</p>
  <div id="api-data-coverage"></div>
</div>

<div class="glass card c12 api-panel" id="worklist">
  <h3>Retrospective patient-prioritization worklist</h3>
  <p class="sub">Explore anonymized encounter-level records from the held-out test set. This is not a live patient list or a clinical triage tool.</p>
  <div class="api-toolbar">
    <select id="worklist-tier" aria-label="Filter by risk tier">
      <option value="All">All risk tiers</option>
      <option value="High">High</option>
      <option value="Medium">Medium</option>
      <option value="Low">Low</option>
